OL,3,GNEWSAHackers steal data from millions
OL,4,Aof airport customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree major UK airports have been hit
OL,7,Fby a "cyber security incident" in which
OL,8,Fcriminal hackers accessed the data of
OL,9,Falmost nine million people and demanded
OL,10,Fa ransom.
OL,12,FManchester Airports Group (MAG), which
OL,13,Fowns Manchester, East Midlands and
OL,14,FLondon Stansted airports, said
OL,15,Fcustomers' contact details, vehicle
OL,16,Fregistrations and postcodes were
OL,17,Fobtained by hackers at the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
