OL,3,GNEWSAHackers steal data from millions
OL,4,Aof airport customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMAG told the BBC the hackers demanded a
OL,7,Fransom fee for the return of the data,
OL,8,Fwhich the group said it refused to pay.
OL,9,FThe sum of the ransom fee was not
OL,10,Fdisclosed.
OL,12,FMAG said "at no point has passenger
OL,13,Fsafety or aviation security been
OL,14,Fcompromised" and the system hacked did
OL,15,Fnot hold customers' bank or payment
OL,16,Fdetails.
